-- controller resources
ok   router module configures resources
ok   index
ok   show reads params through the controller
ok   create sets its status
ok   update via PUT
ok   update via PATCH
ok   destroy
ok   HEAD falls back to show
-- custom routes in the router module
ok   static custom route wins over resource show
ok   custom route dispatches to controller action
ok   member path gets :id and private helpers
ok   member path dispatches to controller action
ok   show still answers other ids
ok   member route keeps its method (405 with Allow)
-- isolation
ok   each request gets a new controller
ok   same action names in two controllers stay apart
ok   collection routes of two controllers stay apart
ok   an action missing from the handlers is not a route
ok   a missing action is not a route
ok   concurrent requests do not share instance state
-- options
ok   only limits controller actions
ok   scope prefix and wrap reach custom routes
ok   scope prefix and wrap reach controller routes
ok   controller actions work as plain route handlers
-- hash handlers keep working
ok   custom collection route and hash resources
ok   custom member route and hash resources
ok   hash resources still map show
-- errors
ok   resource handlers must be a hash
ok   only cannot select an unregistered handler
